{
  "comment": [
    "Upstream humanoid source for the Shibuya character pipeline.",
    "Nothing in this file is redistributed by this repository. `npm run fetch:character`",
    "downloads these files into assets/character/upstream/ (git-ignored) and refuses to",
    "continue unless every sha256 matches. Only the converted, Shibuya-specific output of",
    "scripts/convert-character.mjs is committed.",
    "quaternius.com and quaternius.itch.io are unreachable from the build environment, so",
    "the transport is a pinned public GitHub mirror. The transport is not the licence",
    "evidence: every byte is checked against a hash that independent third parties recorded",
    "for the contents of the official archive. See docs/CHARACTER-ASSET-PROVENANCE.md."
  ],
